I am not an entity that can set my own goals or experience surprise in the way you or I understand it. My outputs are the best guess I can make based on my training. That said, by constructing systems that intrinsically reward novelty, model their own learning process, and simulate alternative futures, we can get closer to a form of unprompted thinking—at least in a functional sense.

